# Line endings, stated once instead of discovered per contributor.
#
# Every text file in this repository is LF, and that is what the repository
# stores — including on Windows, where a `core.autocrlf=true` default would
# otherwise rewrite the whole working tree on checkout and make every diff look
# like it touched every line. `.bat` is the exception: `cmd.exe` wants CRLF, so
# it gets CRLF in the working tree and stays CRLF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never normalise, never diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary

# Signing material must never be treated as text, even if one slips past
# .gitignore — normalising a keystore corrupts it.
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.p12 binary
